stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Active
    Active --> Counting: 1st wrong password
    Counting --> Counting: 2nd to 4th wrong password
    Counting --> Active: correct password, or<br/>15 min since the first failure
    Counting --> Locked: 5th wrong password<br/>within 15 min
    Locked --> Active: 15 min pass
    note right of Locked
        Every attempt gets the same generic 401.
        Wrong passwords don't extend the lock.
    end note
